  - machine learning
  - data visualization
abstract: >
  ICEbox provides tools for constructing and visualizing Individual
  Conditional Expectation plots. These plots show the fitted relationship
  between a feature and the predicted response for individual observations,
  revealing heterogeneous effects and interactions that can be hidden by an
  averaged partial dependence plot.
